OL,3,ABurnham says he will end pensions
OL,4,Atriple lock from 2030 to help fund
OL,5,Anational care service
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham says the government will
OL,8,Fchange the pensions "triple lock" from
OL,9,F2030 to help fund adult social care in
OL,10,FEngland
OL,12,FThe triple lock means the state pension
OL,13,Fcurrently increases annually by
OL,14,Finflation, average wage growth, or 2.5%
OL,15,F- whichever is highest
OL,17,FBut Burnham says that, from April 2030,
OL,18,Fit will "rise at least by prices
OL,19,F[inflation] or 2.5%" and will "hold its
OL,20,Fvalue relative to earnings over time"
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
