OL,3,ABurnham says he will end pensions
OL,4,Atriple lock from 2030 to help fund
OL,5,Anational care service
OL,6,
OL,7,FDetailing a "national care service",
OL,8,FBurnham pledges a system where
OL,9,F"everyone contributes, and everyone is
OL,10,Fcovered - free at the point of use"
OL,12,FOn housing, Burnham pledges to reform
OL,13,Fthe leasehold system, and on water, he
OL,14,Fsays he will end "Margaret Thatcher's
OL,15,Fideological ban" on public ownership
OL,17,FBrexit has done "more harm than good",
OL,18,Fhe says, while he also promises
OL,19,Felectoral reform in Labour's next
OL,20,Fmanifesto. The prime minister also pays
OL,21,Fan emotional tribute to his late father
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
